---
import Article from '../layouts/Article.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---
<Article
  title="Disclaimer"
  heading="Disclaimer"
  description="SalaryLens provides salary estimates for informational purposes only and is not financial, tax or legal advice."
  path="/disclaimer/"
  showCta={false}
>
  <p>
    All figures produced by SalaryLens are <strong>estimates for informational purposes only</strong>
    and do not constitute financial, tax, legal or investment advice.
  </p>
  <p>
    Actual in-hand salary depends on your exact salary structure, employer policies, chosen tax
    regime, declared investments, city of residence and other factors that this tool simplifies or
    cannot know. Tax rules also change with each Union Budget.
  </p>
  <p>
    Company salary structures shown on this site are <strong>typical, community-observed patterns,
    not official figures</strong>, and may not reflect any specific employer's current policy. Your
    official offer letter and payslip are always the authoritative source.
  </p>
  <p>
    Always verify important numbers with a qualified chartered accountant or tax advisor before
    making financial decisions. SalaryLens accepts no liability for decisions made based on these
    estimates. See the <a href={url('/methodology/')}>methodology</a> for our assumptions.
  </p>
</Article>
